        </mxCell>
        <mxCell id="legend-note" value="&lt;i&gt;15 processes from charts/: the eight services, Ticketing's sweeper and reconciler, analytics-ingest and four outbox relays. The stores run in the cluster from infra/stores, not as RDS or MSK: the free plan's SCP leaves out Kafka, and they fit on the two nodes.&lt;/i&gt;" style="text;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;strokeColor=none;fillColor=none;align=left;verticalAlign=top;fontSize=13;fontStyle=0;fontColor=light-dark(#000000,#FFFFFF);fontFamily=Helvetica;" vertex="1" parent="1">
